<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">Dear Opportunity Owner,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">Your opportunity is approaching the Production Start.&nbsp; &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">Account Name:&nbsp;</span></b><font face="Intel Clear, sans-serif">{!Opportunity.Account}</font></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><b><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">Opportunity Name:</span></b><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;"> {!Opportunity.Name} <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">First Customer Ship Date:</span></b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span><font face="Intel Clear, sans-serif">{!Opportunity.Core_First_Customer_Ship_Date__c}</font></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><u><span style="font-family:
&quot;Intel Clear&quot;,sans-serif;color:#0070C0"><a href="{!Opportunity.Link}">Click Here</a></span></u></b><span style="color: rgb(0, 112, 192); font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">to
update the Stage to Production Win once production begins.&nbsp; If the production start has been postponed,
please update the First Customer Ship Date to the current status.</span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">Please make sure the Fulfillment Partner and Manufacturing Region
are entered. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, sans-serif;">If the opportunity will <i>not go into</i> the production, please
change the Stage to Production Loss or Production Cancelled accordingly and
specify the reason for loss or cancellation. There is no impact in the system
on the prior achieved Design Win stage. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">_______________________________________________________________________<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;
font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Light&quot;,sans-serif;color:#666666">This message contains
Intel Confidential information and should be handled in accordance with your
Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) with Intel. Access to this e-mail by anyone
other than the intended recipient is unauthorized. If you are not the intended
recipient (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may
not use, copy, distribute, or deliver this message or any part of its contents
or take any action in reliance on it, and in such case, you should destroy this
message. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;
